+
+This patch implements AV-specific validation, certification, simulation and operational tooling.
+
+Key scripts & flows:
+- Vehicle RT validation: ops/av/rt/vehicle_rt_validation.sh (CAN/TSN sampling + RT lab + SLO proof)
+- CAN sampler: ops/av/rt/can_latency_sampler.py
+- Vehicle SLO guidance: ops/av/slo/vehicle_slo_table.py (compute safe-stop targets from vehicle dynamics)
+- Controller certification harness: ops/av/certification/vehicle_controller_cert_harness.py
+- Perception OOD & adversarial runner: ops/av/perception/ood_and_adversarial_runner.py
+- Sim→HIL pipeline (Argo): ops/av/sim_hil/carla_to_hil_pipeline.yaml + run_carla_batch stub
+- Redundancy / fail‑op checker: ops/av/failop/redundancy_check.py
+- Safety case assembler: ops/av/ops/safety_case_builder.py
+- Canary rollout manager: ops/av/ops/canary_rollout_manager.py
+
+Operator responsibilities:
+- Provide vehicle ECUs, CAN/CAN-FD/TSN access, HIL rig and golden traces.
+- Install vendor SDKs and label self-hosted runners for NPU/GPUs.
+- Supply secrets: COSIGN_KMS_URI, REKOR_SERVER, WATTTIME_API_KEY and S3 evidence bucket.
+- Replace placeholder scenario drivers & waveform comparators with vehicle/HIL-specific implementations.
