+  2) Execute ops/av/certification/vehicle_controller_cert_harness.py to produce HIL certification bundle.
+  3) Run Apalache triage tools and update TLA+ specs until no blocking counterexamples.
+  4) Run perception OOD/adversarial suites and triage model fixes.
+  5) Build safety case via ops/av/ops/safety_case_builder.py and submit bundle to certifier with auditor cover letter.
+
+Security & evidence:
+- Record all runs with ops/sdk/evidence_sdk.record_manifest (scripts included).
+- Keep signed bundles (cosign + Rekor) in S3 with retention per ops/governance/evidence_retention_policy.md.
